creates bedfile for episode from full maf file (gzipped)
removes inseions relative to the human genome
DOES NOT restrict to only bases valid in both species
analyses sequences to find cpg islands using ucsc tool https://genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgTrackUi?g=cpgIslandExt
produces combined_cpgs.bed file with the union of cpg islands from target and anc species
